5636 0 obj
  << /ActualText (As we explored the potential for moving units or pieces across a board with magnets\054 we proposed an idea involving creating a swarm of units that move across a board in a hypnotizing and elegant way\056\n\nAn obstacle was the usage of mini servo robot arms with a 5V allowance\054 as this would allow for few robot arms that can only be moved individually\056 This led us to consider other mediums that could create a similarly engaging effect\056\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWith a variety of references we settled for sand as a non\055magnetic medium as ferrofluids or magnetic powder could potentially be a hazard\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 5637 0 R
     /Pg 1536 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
